---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Gridwatch"
  description="Independent of the Electricity Authority. Built from public EMI data."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About Gridwatch</h1>
    <p>
      Gridwatch is an independent site about the New Zealand electricity market,
      put together from the Electricity Authority's public EMI files. The
      Authority doesn't run this, and neither does the grid operator.
    </p>
    <p>
      It's for people who want to know what the market did, without working in
      it. When prices jump we don't treat that as a scandal or a win; we stick
      to what the numbers show.
    </p>
    <p>This isn't a feed for running the power system.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: var(--measure-prose);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }
</style>
